WEBVTT

00:40.660 --> 00:42.200
Hold on, Zero.

00:42.200 --> 00:45.500
I'll definitely keep my
promise and get you out!

00:53.030 --> 00:54.070
Listen.

00:54.700 --> 00:56.420
It's the sound of the midnight clock.

00:57.750 --> 01:00.030
It's your birthday,

01:00.040 --> 01:01.240
my little princess.

01:06.370 --> 01:07.780
You can't die here.

01:07.780 --> 01:08.820
I...

01:09.170 --> 01:11.630
I'll definitely get you out of here!

01:19.930 --> 01:22.350
The trigger's jammed.

01:29.870 --> 01:33.780
Is this where you will die, Renata?

01:43.620 --> 01:44.660
Swift here.

01:44.660 --> 01:46.070
Black Swan Bay is burning.

01:46.070 --> 01:48.210
Nearly all of the buildings
have been destroyed.

01:48.500 --> 01:50.750
It looks like there's no going back.

01:50.750 --> 01:53.760
I received an order from above
to start Operation Swan Death.

01:53.760 --> 01:57.250
Remember, not even a single strand
of hair can leave Black Swan Bay!

01:58.090 --> 01:59.130
Roger.

02:00.490 --> 02:02.930
White Stork, there are still
survivors in the port.

02:02.930 --> 02:04.060
Do they need rescuing?

02:04.060 --> 02:06.270
No matter who they are, wipe them out.

02:06.270 --> 02:08.230
You must make sure everyone is dead!

02:11.940 --> 02:13.830
I haven't given you my gift yet.

02:13.830 --> 02:15.290
How can you die?

02:16.720 --> 02:20.070
A lovely flower shouldn't freeze
to death on this damned snowy night.

02:20.710 --> 02:21.750
Come.

02:22.450 --> 02:24.320
Accept this gift from the king.

02:24.320 --> 02:26.290
Open your very first present.

02:27.760 --> 02:29.290
From now on, your destiny

02:29.830 --> 02:32.280
will no longer end in this blizzard.

02:33.450 --> 02:34.800
Let's renew our contract.

02:35.580 --> 02:38.590
From now on, I'll always keep you at my side.

02:38.590 --> 02:40.120
I'll never give up,

02:40.120 --> 02:41.410
never leave.

02:41.920 --> 02:44.250
You must live well,

02:45.250 --> 02:47.510
and always be useful to me.

02:49.430 --> 02:51.950
White Stork, a strange ball of
light has appeared in the smoke.

02:51.950 --> 02:52.990
Damn it!

02:53.040 --> 02:54.170
Are there any survivors?

02:54.170 --> 02:55.590
Wipe them out right now!

02:55.590 --> 02:56.310
Roger.

02:56.310 --> 02:57.440
Wiping them out right now.

02:57.450 --> 03:00.330
The king's language will cause reincarnation.

03:00.330 --> 03:02.300
He will erase the records on the inscription.

03:02.300 --> 03:04.070
He will erase your death.

03:04.480 --> 03:06.480
Do not die!

03:06.480 --> 03:10.130
Hear your king. Now rewind.

03:10.690 --> 03:14.590
No words engraved on the stone.

03:14.590 --> 03:19.670
No souls resting beneath the earth.

03:20.010 --> 03:21.380
Rise again!

03:28.540 --> 03:29.810
Lie still.

03:30.080 --> 03:31.730
The starlight is the tomb.

03:31.730 --> 03:33.610
The earth is the stage.

03:33.610 --> 03:36.550
The wind, the cheers and
the thunder, the applause.

03:36.550 --> 03:38.780
This is what magic should be like.

03:38.780 --> 03:40.900
Reality is crueler than fairy tales,

03:41.410 --> 03:42.750
but much more beautiful.

03:43.360 --> 03:44.400
Don't you agree?

03:50.440 --> 03:53.170
Sometimes I pity you,

03:53.170 --> 03:54.770
but most of the time,

03:55.580 --> 03:57.920
your stupidity is unforgivable!

03:58.660 --> 04:00.340
After a millennium,

04:00.340 --> 04:04.300
Satan will be released from prison!

04:13.520 --> 04:14.560
What...

04:15.150 --> 04:17.020
...on earth are you?

04:17.960 --> 04:19.530
That kid is flying!

04:19.530 --> 04:21.060
What the hell is he?

04:21.950 --> 04:23.520
Fire all missiles!

04:23.520 --> 04:25.740
Fire! Quick! Fire!

04:26.580 --> 04:28.740
Awaken, beast!

04:32.580 --> 04:33.680
A direct hit!

04:33.680 --> 04:35.180
That thing must be dead.

04:39.790 --> 04:40.840
That's...

04:45.220 --> 04:47.520
-The Mourner's Eyes-

04:47.520 --> 04:50.940
Episode 1

04:51.540 --> 04:54.870
Having escaped from Black Swan Bay,
test subjects Zero and Renata

04:54.870 --> 04:57.450
are on a mountain road
outside of Blagoveshchensk.

04:57.450 --> 04:58.940
Target destination is unknown.

04:57.450 --> 04:58.940
We're being tracked.

04:59.540 --> 05:01.210
I don't have time to deal with that.

05:01.860 --> 05:02.690
Your body...

05:02.690 --> 05:03.740
It's fine.

05:04.160 --> 05:05.580
Should we attack?

05:05.580 --> 05:06.240
No.

05:06.240 --> 05:08.640
This area is the territory of
the Caduceus Organization,

05:08.640 --> 05:11.020
an organization always
hidden in the shadows.

05:11.020 --> 05:12.620
No one has actually seen them,

05:12.620 --> 05:15.710
but they always leave a caduceus
symbol behind after they strike,

05:15.710 --> 05:18.790
so we call them the "Caduceus Organization."

05:18.790 --> 05:21.550
Test subject Zero’s power
is severely lacking; however,

05:21.550 --> 05:23.590
it's enough to deal with their pursuers.

05:23.590 --> 05:25.010
Notify the execution bureau.

05:25.010 --> 05:27.980
All nearby specialist executives of rank A
or higher are to assemble immediately.

05:27.980 --> 05:30.180
This time, it's a S-rank mission.

05:32.100 --> 05:34.370
I still don't think you should
participate in this mission,

05:34.370 --> 05:36.060
since you're pregnant.

05:36.060 --> 05:38.660
Test subject Zero is very likely
one of the Dragon Kings.

05:38.660 --> 05:41.060
I can't miss an opportunity to contact him.

05:41.060 --> 05:44.320
Also, without me, none of you in
the Execution Bureau can catch him.

05:44.990 --> 05:45.950
Okay.

05:45.950 --> 05:49.200
I will protect you and our child.

05:49.200 --> 05:50.980
Cassel's Qiguo branch is assembled.

05:50.980 --> 05:52.080
Awaiting target location.

05:52.080 --> 05:54.470
The target location will be
the icy lake in the mountains.

05:54.470 --> 05:55.160
Roger.

05:55.160 --> 05:56.210
We will go there immediately.

06:08.470 --> 06:09.510
What's up?

06:09.760 --> 06:12.140
I hear hooves approaching.

06:13.280 --> 06:14.600
I can't hear them.

06:23.300 --> 06:25.400
We should be out of danger for now.

06:25.400 --> 06:26.640
Then what should we do?

06:26.640 --> 06:28.020
I want to go to Xinguo.

06:28.020 --> 06:29.110
Xinguo?

06:29.110 --> 06:31.160
Xinguo is south of Qiguo.

06:31.160 --> 06:32.250
It's very warm there.

06:32.250 --> 06:34.400
There are four seasons in a year.

06:34.400 --> 06:36.270
Flowers bloom in three of them.

06:36.270 --> 06:38.250
There are thousands of different flowers.

06:38.250 --> 06:41.840
In spring, there are different colored
flowers blooming in every valley.

06:41.840 --> 06:42.920
I'll show you.

06:43.470 --> 06:45.040
Then we'll go south to Xinguo,

06:45.040 --> 06:47.090
where it'll be warmer.

06:47.090 --> 06:50.590
Also, the power I need is there.

06:50.590 --> 06:51.630
They...

06:52.370 --> 06:53.600
...have revived.

06:56.640 --> 06:57.910
I'll come with you,

06:57.910 --> 06:59.170
but how will we get there?

06:59.170 --> 07:01.330
We'll follow this black railway,

07:01.330 --> 07:03.770
and try our luck to catch a train.

07:05.330 --> 07:06.110
You...

07:06.110 --> 07:07.150
I'm fine.

07:07.540 --> 07:09.120
If we crawl into an oil tanker,

07:09.120 --> 07:10.790
we'll be there when we wake up.

07:10.790 --> 07:11.830
Let's go.

07:32.290 --> 07:33.930
This train doesn't have power.

07:34.870 --> 07:36.130
We can use the wind as power,

07:36.130 --> 07:37.390
and fire as electricity.

07:37.390 --> 07:39.770
The heat in the ground and wings in the sky

07:39.770 --> 07:42.440
are like my hands and feet.

07:42.440 --> 07:44.520
Activate!

07:55.410 --> 07:56.700
Sit here and wait for me.

08:00.020 --> 08:00.950
Where are you going?

08:00.950 --> 08:02.710
To deal with the pursuers.

08:03.080 --> 08:05.330
Is it that god you mentioned?

08:05.330 --> 08:08.630
No. With this train, he can't
catch up to us for now,

08:08.630 --> 08:11.510
but the ants under his command are close.

08:16.300 --> 08:17.280
White Stork, White Stork.

08:17.280 --> 08:18.350
Target identified.

08:18.350 --> 08:19.450
Fire at will.

08:19.450 --> 08:21.910
Past the icy lake ahead is
Cassel College's territory.

08:21.910 --> 08:23.430
They must not reach it!

08:23.430 --> 08:24.290
Order received.

08:24.290 --> 08:25.940
Everyone, open fire!

08:28.230 --> 08:30.480
Take the king's words as the order.

08:30.480 --> 08:32.120
Lightning, flash for your king.

08:32.120 --> 08:33.800
Lava, burn with your king.

08:33.800 --> 08:36.040
Light, air, and all elements,

08:36.040 --> 08:37.780
follow me, follow your king.

08:37.780 --> 08:42.830
Heavens and earth, bow to
the power of my words!

08:43.190 --> 08:45.440
Bring me the wind!

08:53.220 --> 08:55.450
The sky is full of tornadoes.

08:55.450 --> 08:58.050
There's... no way we can
continue with the mission.

08:58.500 --> 09:00.640
Thunder, come!

09:00.640 --> 09:02.200
Oh, no! Now there's lightning!

09:02.200 --> 09:03.930
We're being attacked by lightning!

09:04.520 --> 09:05.590
Fire, come!

09:08.190 --> 09:10.620
Become a giant python and strangle the sky!

09:11.820 --> 09:13.520
No... No!

09:17.570 --> 09:18.580
Ice!

09:18.580 --> 09:19.620
Shatter!

09:30.840 --> 09:32.360
It's a bit windy.

09:32.360 --> 09:33.640
Shall we move to a different carriage?

09:35.510 --> 09:36.550
Your hand...

09:37.490 --> 09:38.530
It's fine.

09:39.030 --> 09:40.100
It was just the skin.

09:53.270 --> 09:54.310
Thank you.

10:05.040 --> 10:06.060
Principal,

10:06.080 --> 10:08.500
the train should arrive
earlier than expected.

10:08.880 --> 10:10.820
Many specialists have not yet assembled.

10:10.820 --> 10:11.860
It's fine.

10:12.000 --> 10:14.420
Lu Lincheng, Giovanna, where are you?

10:14.420 --> 10:15.690
We're nearby.

10:15.690 --> 10:17.300
We can meet you in five minutes.

10:17.610 --> 10:18.610
Good.

10:18.610 --> 10:20.080
Students,

10:20.080 --> 10:21.470
according to the intel,

10:21.470 --> 10:25.100
there's a Dragon King on the
train you're about to attack.

10:25.100 --> 10:28.080
We don't know which of the four he is,

10:28.080 --> 10:31.230
but there's no doubt he's a terrifying
foe whom we've never seen before.

10:31.660 --> 10:32.830
In a few minutes,

10:32.830 --> 10:34.780
all of you might be injured,

10:34.780 --> 10:36.080
or even die in battle.

10:36.080 --> 10:38.560
But in order for humans to
eventually eliminate the Dragon Raja,

10:38.560 --> 10:40.910
please put your bodies and lives on the line.

10:40.910 --> 10:43.990
Your glory and blood shall
be scattered across the land,

10:43.990 --> 10:45.950
and will co-exist with
the future of humanity.

10:45.950 --> 10:47.090
Commence...

10:47.660 --> 10:48.830
the mission!

10:48.830 --> 10:50.120
Attack!

10:58.890 --> 11:01.510
Someone has broken into the train.

11:01.510 --> 11:05.000
127 people, all hybrids.

11:05.000 --> 11:06.160
You...

11:06.160 --> 11:07.270
Close your eyes.

11:07.270 --> 11:09.630
You won't want to see what's coming next.

11:09.630 --> 11:10.670
Okay.

11:12.730 --> 11:16.620
They need this train to escape
from the Caduceus Organization.

11:16.620 --> 11:19.530
He won't use a major
Yanling inside the carriage.

11:19.920 --> 11:22.000
Hybrid bastards.

11:22.000 --> 11:23.200
The king doesn't need...

11:23.950 --> 11:25.880
a Yanling to kill you!

11:35.490 --> 11:36.530
Next!

11:38.460 --> 11:39.500
Kneel!

11:41.830 --> 11:44.470
Bloodline Suppression...

11:44.770 --> 11:46.400
Bastards,

11:46.400 --> 11:48.330
as long as dragon blood flows within you,

11:48.330 --> 11:50.520
you are unable to disobey my commands!

11:57.750 --> 12:00.080
Forcefully using human blood
to suppress dragon blood

12:00.080 --> 12:01.830
and overcome Bloodline Suppression?

12:02.450 --> 12:03.540
Shatter!

12:03.540 --> 12:05.400
Your location is my location!

12:05.400 --> 12:07.500
Yanling: Distance Control!

12:08.720 --> 12:09.760
Burn.

12:11.540 --> 12:12.800
Your body is dirty.

12:12.800 --> 12:14.000
Let me clean you up.

12:14.640 --> 12:16.010
Do it when I come back.

12:16.010 --> 12:17.880
I'll sort out the rest of them at the front.

12:17.880 --> 12:19.960
With rage, my bones and hair,

12:19.960 --> 12:22.320
become steel whips to destroy the enemy!

12:30.240 --> 12:32.140
Everything before me, vaporize!

12:32.140 --> 12:33.850
Yanling: Evaporate!

12:33.850 --> 12:35.810
In this era,

12:35.810 --> 12:38.800
even a Yanling like Evaporate
is used for combat.

12:42.690 --> 12:45.200
My fist shall solidify everything.

12:45.200 --> 12:47.410
Yanling: Petrify!

12:54.080 --> 12:54.720
Yanling—

12:54.720 --> 12:55.830
Don't embarrass yourself.

12:57.040 --> 12:58.400
As per the contract,

12:58.400 --> 12:59.910
I am the companion of steel!

12:59.920 --> 13:01.800
Yanling: Steel Share!

13:01.800 --> 13:03.990
This is how you use Steel Share.

13:03.990 --> 13:04.720
As per the commandment,

13:04.720 --> 13:06.270
I am the master of steel.

13:06.270 --> 13:08.550
Yanling: Steel Share!

13:09.180 --> 13:12.010
The curved crown defies logic,
and the earth becomes the sky.

13:12.010 --> 13:13.310
Yanling: Reversal!

13:16.900 --> 13:19.650
Yanling which control gravity
are best kept sealed

13:19.650 --> 13:20.900
and only used sparingly.

13:46.580 --> 13:47.620
How are you?

13:49.180 --> 13:51.050
This body can't handle much more.

13:52.010 --> 13:53.290
Wait for my signal,

13:53.290 --> 13:56.870
and open my first gift to you.

13:57.440 --> 13:58.500
Don't worry.

13:58.500 --> 14:00.110
This is only a preview.

14:00.770 --> 14:04.480
The real show... is about to begin.

14:04.480 --> 14:07.540
Our forces have almost been wiped out.

14:07.540 --> 14:08.750
The intel is wrong.

14:08.750 --> 14:11.070
The enemy is far stronger than expected.

14:11.070 --> 14:12.770
Lu Lincheng, Giovanna,

14:12.770 --> 14:14.740
your new orders are to delay them.

14:15.080 --> 14:17.460
You mustn't let them step foot in Xinguo.

14:17.460 --> 14:19.290
Wait for my next order.

14:25.460 --> 14:28.250
If we could've gotten here earlier,

14:28.250 --> 14:30.720
maybe there wouldn't have been
so many sacrifices.

14:31.080 --> 14:33.750
Just the... two of you?

14:34.920 --> 14:36.230
Honestly...

14:36.230 --> 14:37.600
So reckless.

14:38.550 --> 14:40.730
A hybrid, and a pregnant woman.

14:41.250 --> 14:43.170
Honestly, so reckless.

14:44.410 --> 14:45.500
Are you a hero?

14:46.670 --> 14:49.120
That's just a fairy tale
ants made up for themselves.

14:49.990 --> 14:51.280
What a shame.

14:51.580 --> 14:53.910
Ants always wake up too
late from their dreams.

14:55.450 --> 14:57.040
It doesn't take two people.

14:57.040 --> 15:00.870
I alone am enough to stop this
train and derail your plan.

15:01.580 --> 15:03.210
So much confidence!

15:03.210 --> 15:04.450
I love it.

15:04.990 --> 15:07.000
But you should turn around and have a look.

15:07.000 --> 15:10.050
We'll be at the Xinguo border in two minutes.

15:10.880 --> 15:13.590
Do you think there's still a chance?

15:14.490 --> 15:18.590
We plan to have iron pot
stew and take a bath.

15:19.100 --> 15:20.690
Why so nervous?

15:20.690 --> 15:23.440
Two minutes... will be plenty.

15:27.280 --> 15:28.610
So it's like that.

15:29.300 --> 15:31.120
Delay tactics.

15:31.120 --> 15:33.280
Waiting for your main squad to arrive?

15:33.410 --> 15:36.410
They're here to stop us from reaching Xinguo.

15:36.450 --> 15:38.160
We must fight quickly.

15:38.160 --> 15:40.290
Mantis Barrier!

15:47.090 --> 15:49.760
It's time to end your rampage!

15:52.660 --> 15:54.390
My Yanling can penetrate anything

15:54.390 --> 15:56.390
and wipe out all life.

15:56.390 --> 15:57.510
It's unblockable.

15:57.510 --> 15:59.240
Yanling from the heavens.

15:59.730 --> 16:03.770
Extracting highly radioactive
rare metals from the earth,

16:03.770 --> 16:07.130
which can penetrate all lifeforms
and destroy all existence.

16:08.290 --> 16:09.610
That's very powerful.

16:14.330 --> 16:15.460
Concentrate.

16:16.570 --> 16:17.610
Release!

16:19.160 --> 16:20.570
Fool.

16:20.570 --> 16:22.250
You know I'm not affected by Yanling.

16:22.640 --> 16:23.670
Yanling: Dark Light!

16:23.670 --> 16:24.750
Refraction!

16:25.500 --> 16:27.660
Our goal is to delay you.

16:27.660 --> 16:30.050
You must have a reason to
escape with a little girl.

16:30.540 --> 16:32.800
I bet you will save her!

16:32.800 --> 16:34.320
Renata,

16:34.320 --> 16:35.750
open the gift!

16:39.970 --> 16:42.080
Yan...ling:

16:42.080 --> 16:43.180
Mirror Pupil.

16:43.310 --> 16:45.230
Copy. Dark Light.

16:45.230 --> 16:46.700
Refraction.

16:47.110 --> 16:48.730
Copying Yanling? Watch out!

16:49.220 --> 16:51.180
Game over.

16:51.920 --> 16:53.150
You lose.

16:53.150 --> 16:56.240
Go to hell with the Yanling
that you're so proud of.

16:57.120 --> 16:59.780
The entire family of three.

16:59.780 --> 17:01.830
Yanling: Zero Time!

17:09.750 --> 17:11.700
You finally showed up.

17:11.700 --> 17:12.800
They were waiting for you.

17:16.220 --> 17:17.380
Old man...

17:17.950 --> 17:20.750
Working hard despite your hair going gray.

17:20.750 --> 17:23.500
Sending youngsters to fight
your battles in your old age?

17:23.500 --> 17:24.540
What a pity.

17:25.100 --> 17:27.270
Aren't you disappointed with this world?

17:27.270 --> 17:28.340
Isn't it sad?

17:29.080 --> 17:30.900
You're the one who's disappointed.

17:30.900 --> 17:33.400
It's a shame you're only one minute away.

17:33.400 --> 17:35.290
But don't look down on the elderly.

17:35.290 --> 17:38.280
You tricked my honest students,
but you cannot trick me.

17:38.280 --> 17:40.580
You're the one who's dying.

17:40.960 --> 17:43.240
No, you're not human.

17:43.240 --> 17:44.630
You're a monster.

17:45.120 --> 17:46.660
In this single minute,

17:46.660 --> 17:48.500
say your last words.

17:48.500 --> 17:51.580
Using your lovely students as
cannon fodder to grind me down.

17:51.580 --> 17:53.440
What's that saying they have in Xinguo?

17:54.120 --> 17:56.200
The elderly are extremely sly and cunning.

17:56.200 --> 17:57.810
I should applaud you,

17:57.810 --> 18:00.340
using bones as drumsticks and lies as drums.

18:01.330 --> 18:02.830
But enough of the drama.

18:02.830 --> 18:05.000
This body has indeed reached its limit.

18:05.770 --> 18:07.000
Old man...

18:08.270 --> 18:12.250
Believe it or not, I can replace this
blizzard with scenery from hell

18:12.250 --> 18:14.440
before you can even blink.

18:14.440 --> 18:15.630
Perhaps...

18:16.080 --> 18:18.150
you'd like the scenery there.

18:18.410 --> 18:19.980
There's no point in killing me.

18:19.980 --> 18:21.720
Backup will be here soon.

18:21.720 --> 18:23.580
In any case, you will not escape today.

18:24.120 --> 18:26.240
Having killed so many of my students,

18:26.240 --> 18:28.500
I am going to have you two monsters

18:28.500 --> 18:31.050
torn apart, from skin to bone.

18:32.540 --> 18:33.590
Grandpa,

18:34.040 --> 18:35.220
you're getting old.

18:35.220 --> 18:36.860
You should learn to cherish life.

18:37.670 --> 18:38.720
However,

18:39.710 --> 18:41.300
I dislike both sides suffering losses.

18:43.200 --> 18:45.000
I know what you want.

18:45.920 --> 18:48.090
Today is Renata's birthday.

18:48.090 --> 18:49.730
I don't want to spoil her day.

18:50.640 --> 18:51.770
Let's make a deal.

18:54.630 --> 18:55.690
Agree to my conditions,

18:56.540 --> 18:58.820
and I'll give you this big gift.

18:58.820 --> 19:00.830
The Dragon Raja cannot be trusted.

19:00.830 --> 19:02.780
The Dragon Raja values promises the most.

19:02.780 --> 19:05.020
The king never lies.

19:05.800 --> 19:08.160
There's something in here that
you've been searching for.

19:08.160 --> 19:10.140
But even if you want to break into it,

19:10.140 --> 19:11.210
it's impossible.

19:11.210 --> 19:13.710
As for the key, don't worry.

19:14.300 --> 19:16.340
It will find you sooner or later.

19:17.120 --> 19:18.920
What are your conditions?

19:21.330 --> 19:23.090
Take care of Renata for me.

19:23.090 --> 19:24.630
When the time comes,

19:25.610 --> 19:28.020
you will get what you want.

19:32.550 --> 19:34.640
From now on,

19:34.640 --> 19:37.480
she will be my most cherished student.

19:42.870 --> 19:44.870
This is my second birthday gift to you.

19:45.310 --> 19:47.790
I haven't decided on the third one yet.

19:48.680 --> 19:51.000
Let's wait until spring,
when the flowers bloom.

19:51.710 --> 19:52.950
Little princess,

19:54.230 --> 19:55.840
I need to sleep now.

19:56.540 --> 19:57.920
You are mine.

19:58.960 --> 20:00.220
From now on,

20:00.690 --> 20:03.380
you will take my name: Zero.

20:05.380 --> 20:06.420
Live on,

20:07.280 --> 20:08.320
Zero.

20:23.350 --> 20:25.670
Actually, I already tried my best.

20:25.670 --> 20:28.460
But Principal, you know how fast bikes are.

20:28.460 --> 20:29.910
I really didn't mean it.

20:29.910 --> 20:32.610
Oh, yes. Has the secret of the
Dragon King been obtained?

20:32.610 --> 20:34.620
With you here, Principal,
it won't be a problem.

20:35.520 --> 20:36.560
I got it.

20:37.530 --> 20:39.620
As expected of the Principal!

20:39.620 --> 20:40.660
Your next mission.

20:41.420 --> 20:43.880
Take a helicopter to Xinguo immediately.

20:43.880 --> 20:46.140
Your new identity is a hired driver.

20:46.500 --> 20:49.370
Remember, you must keep this briefcase,

20:49.370 --> 20:51.180
until I need you again.

20:51.930 --> 20:54.250
Find a girlfriend in Xinguo,

20:54.250 --> 20:55.630
and start a family.

20:55.630 --> 20:57.400
Pretend to be a normal person.

20:59.790 --> 21:01.030
Are drivers treated well?

21:01.030 --> 21:02.070
No.

21:02.960 --> 21:04.030
I knew it.

21:04.590 --> 21:05.630
Don't worry.

21:05.750 --> 21:09.050
The briefcase is definitely safe with me.

21:09.050 --> 21:10.130
Chu Tianjiao.

21:14.520 --> 21:15.560
I'm sorry.

21:24.680 --> 21:25.720
I'm sorry.

21:29.990 --> 21:31.750
Find a girlfriend...

21:32.790 --> 21:34.680
The principal looks down on me too much.

21:35.230 --> 21:37.730
Old man, I'll surprise you!

21:43.160 --> 21:44.940
Zihang, good boy.

21:45.620 --> 21:47.520
Zihang is such a good boy!

21:52.320 --> 21:55.250
He has black hair, like you.

21:55.250 --> 21:57.450
Let's give him a Chinese name.

21:58.800 --> 21:59.920
Let's call him...

22:01.120 --> 22:02.630
Lu Mingfei.
